==Overview==
The '''Arachnid Militant Toilet''' is a unit that has been added in the [[Episode 75 Update|Episode 75 Update.]]

== Appearance ==
The toilet seems to have six spider legs that oddly, are not on the ground, but rather than sideways. Two of its arms have saws on them as well and three blasters (two smaller ones below toilet, and one big one above it) with a helmet on its head.

==Obtainment==
You can get this unit from the [[Summoning|Summoning Area]]. It is a [[Mythic]] unit, and has a 0.1% chance to be summoned in the [[Basic Crate]], along with a 1.5% chance in the [[Mythic Crate]].
