==Trivia==
*This unit is based off the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Buzzsaw_Soldier_Skibidi_Toilet Buzzsaw Soldier Skibidi Toilet] from the Skibidi Toilet series.
* The name "arachnid" is a type of animal, as known as an animal with 8 legs. (Examples such as spiders, and scorpions.)
*This is the second toilet unit ever in the game, the first one being [[Scientist Mech]].
*This is just a slightly worse version of the [[Knife Upgraded Titan Speakerman]], as it does not have any AoE capabilities. It also cannot block stuns.
